        "content": "<p>shrayjaiswal050-design opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14780\">PR #14780</a> from <code>shrayjaiswal050-design:fix-cow-order-memory-init</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Fixes #14585.</p>\n<p>Prevents CoW memory images from being created when an active table initializer may trap, so memory remains zero-initialized if startup aborts.</p>\n<p>Tests:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>cargo test --test wast -- cow-order</li>\n<li>cargo check -p wasmtime-environ</li>\n<li>cargo fmt -p wasmtime-environ -- --check</li>\n<li>git diff --check</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
